#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/linux-pam.xml:386
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>PAM</application> man page (<command>man pam</command>) "
"provides a good starting point to learn about the several fields, and "
"allowable entries.  The <ulink url=\"https://www.docs4dev.com/docs/en/linux-"
"pam/1.1.2/reference/Linux-PAM_SAG.html\"> Linux-PAM System Administrators' "
"Guide </ulink> is recommended for additional information."
msgstr ""
"A página de manual do <application>PAM</application> (<command>man "
"pam</command>) fornece um bom ponto de partida para aprender a respeito dos "
"diversos campos e entradas permitidas. O <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.docs4dev.com/docs/en/linux-pam/1.1.2/reference/Linux-"
"PAM_SAG.html\">Guia do(a) Administrador(a) do Sistema Linux-PAM</ulink> é "
"recomendado para informação adicional."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><important><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/linux-pam.xml:399
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You should now reinstall the <xref linkend=\"shadow\"/> <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\">package</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\"> and <xref "
"linkend=\"systemd\"/> packages</phrase>."
msgstr ""
"Você agora deveria reinstalar <phrase revision=\"sysv\">o pacote</phrase> "
"<phrase revision=\"systemd\"> os pacotes <xref linkend=\"systemd\"/> e</"
"phrase> <xref linkend=\"shadow\"/>."

